  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can call forth a howling creature of shadow to hound your foes. You can spend 3 Sorcery Points to cast @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.6RTnNWs5mJgj9f3K]{Summon Beast} as a Bonus Action without expending a spell slot, without preparing the spell, and without Material components. The creature appears as a beast made of shadow, and enemies within 5 feet of it have Disadvantage on saving throws against spells you cast. Whenever you cast the spell, you can modify it so that it doesn't require Concentration; the spell's duration then becomes 1 minute for that casting, and it ends early if you cast the spell again.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-b209DwtUuJCbeHlN\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Cast it as a Bonus Action.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
